  "HDDS-5815": {
    "jira_id": "HDDS-5815",
    "issue_type": "Improvement",
    "resolution": "Fixed",
    "title": "FileEncryptionInfo is not necessary to be referenced inside KeyOutputStream",
    "description": "Currently the RPCClient sets the open key session to the KeyOutputStream during a write initialization.\r\nFrom the OpenKeySession, the KeyOutputStream fetches the OMKeyInfo, and then from that the FileEncryptionInfo.\r\nThe sole reason to do this is to provide a getter for the FileEncryptionInfo object, which then retrieved by the RPCClient later on.\r\n\r\nSo that the reference can be removed from KeyOutputStream as it is unnecessary at the moment.",
